'''T3-K10''' was an [[astromech droid]] manufactured by [[Duwani Mechanical Products]]<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition" /> and owned by [[Freya Fenris]] of [[Ace Squadron]],<ref name="The High Tower" /> co-[[pilot]]ing Freya's customized ship ''[[Red Ace]]''.

T3-K10's design was a modern twist on an ancient yet efficient design that was back in style. It was able to make rapid navigational computations and was as capable co-piloting larger [[starship]]s as it was a [[starfighter]].<ref name="SWE CGSWG">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> T3-K10's design also resembled<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition" /> an [[Unidentified maintenance droid (ML-08)|ancient model of maintenance droid]].<ref name="TEOL">{{IDWAdventuresCite-2017|annual=2018|story=The Lost Eggs of Livorno}}</ref>

